@startuml state-room
title State Machine: Room (owned by Backend) [P]
[*] --> OPEN : create (FR-030)
OPEN --> OPEN : join / leave / ready / loadout change
OPEN --> STARTING : host Start valid (FR-036)
STARTING --> OPEN : allocation failed (503)
STARTING --> IN_MATCH : Match Server AssignAck
IN_MATCH --> POST_MATCH : match COMPLETED | ABORTED
POST_MATCH --> OPEN : rematch / remain [TBD OQ-GP-14]
POST_MATCH --> CLOSED : all left or idle timeout
OPEN --> CLOSED : host closes | idle timeout (P: 30 min) | all members left
CLOSED --> [*]
note right of OPEN
  Invariants:
  - competitors <= 5 (BR-001)
  - code unique among non-CLOSED rooms
  - host leaves -> transfer or close [TBD OQ-GP-13]
end note
@enduml
